OL,3,GNEWSAHow a duck is putting a town 'back
OL,4,Aon the map'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are many creative ways to promote
OL,7,Fa town's heritage ` but not many of
OL,8,Fthem involve a "duck" creating viral
OL,9,Fvideos.
OL,11,FThe quacking idea was the brainchild of
OL,12,Fconservation architect Christian
OL,13,FMontez, who has been donning a duck
OL,14,Fmask to highlight the history of his
OL,15,Fhometown of Leominster, Herefordshire.
OL,17,FAs well as featuring himself in his
OL,18,Funusual attire, the videos include
OL,19,Fcatchy songs played along to images of
OL,20,Fsome of the town's historical
OL,21,Farchitecture.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
